'''Dark Descent''' (闇討ち ''Yamiuchi'', '''Darkness''') is a group of special stages appearing during special occasions.

Each stage includes [[Timed Score Reward]]s which feature [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark Enemies]] exclusively. All stages feature XP and a [[Cat Capsule#Normal Cat Capsule|Cat Ticket]] as timed score rewards, with the exceptions of [[Northern Crater|Dark Descent ∞]]. [[Western Walk (Cover of Darkness)|Western Walk]] and [[Final Battleground]], which all have additional rewards.

